            <div xml:id="d409">

                <pb facs="0547" n="437" sameAs="frus:frus1931v03/pg437"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/2670: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Forbes</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-11-14T11:00:00+09:00">November 14, 1931—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received November 14—4:29 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>217. Your 266 [<hi rendition="#italic">226</hi>], November 13, 11 a.m. I have
                    carefully refrained from making any statement which could be construed to
                    indicate an expression of my Government’s attitude or of mine regarding the new
                    Japanese position.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Forbes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
